, Mr. Vergara, speaking to the local Asimet trade group, reiterated the bank can't rule out \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but that such a move can be very costly.\par \par \uc2 Write to Carolina Pica at carolina.pica@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 May 08, 2013 09:43 ET (13:43 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020130508e958003fr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
