\par\par \b \uc2 DJ UPDATE: Chile Finance Min: Capital Controls Used Only As Last Resort\b0\par\par\uc2 481 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 April 2013\par 18:09\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2013, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 --Government's $5 billion, peso-denominated bond issue schedule aims to ease pressure on peso\par \par \uc2 --Quantitative easing to blame for strong \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in several Latin American nations\par \par \uc2 --Finance Minister reiterates \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  autonomously decides whether to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO, \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 --Capital controls are measures of last resort and the Chilean government won't easily implement them to stem the strength of the peso in relation to the dollar, Finance Minister Felipe Larrain said Friday.\par \par \uc2 Earlier this week, the peso traded at 20-month highs versus the dollar, prompting concerns that exporters continue to lose their competitiveness and calls for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Mr. Larrain said the government is contributing to reducing pressure on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and, to that effect, on Thursday disclosed a $5 billion local bond issue schedule for this year.\par \par \uc2 By issuing bonds denominated in pesos, he said, the government aims to reduce its dollar sales on the local market, which is already flooded with dollars as investors seek more-attractive returns on their investments than in industrialized nations where interest rates are near zero.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Larrain reiterated that the aggressive stimulus Japan, the U.S. and the E.U. had injected into their economies were mostly to blame for the strength of the peso.\par \par \uc2 "The rest of the world is suffering the effects of quantitative easing," Mr. Larrain told assistants at Banco BCI seminar, adding that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Chile and several other Latin American countries were taking a beating.\par \par \uc2 "Europe, Japan, and the U.S. don't have any more room to use fiscal or monetary policies so they turn to injections of liquidity. The problem is that successful emerging-market nations are paying the consequences," he said.\par \par \uc2 As a result of the peso's sharp gains this week, many market participants were betting that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would disclose \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  measures following its monthly monetary-policy meeting late Thursday.\par \par \uc2 While the bank didn't announce an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , it mentioned, in its post-meeting communique, that the peso had continued firming in multilateral terms. It also said copper prices, a key indicator for the peso as Chile produces one-third of the world's copper, had fallen on international markets, hinting that the peso wasn't in line with its fundamentals.\par \par \uc2 The finance minister sits in on the bank's monthly policy meetings and voices his opinion, but he doesn't have a vote on the five-person governing council.\par \par \uc2 Asked if he had discussed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  with \b \highlight22\uc2 central-bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  authorities, Mr. Larrain told reporters on the sidelines of the seminar that "no issue was taboo."\par \par \uc2 He reiterated, however, that to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is the prerogative of the autonomous \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Write to Carolina Pica at carolina.pica@dowjones.com.\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 April 12, 2013 12:09 ET (16:09 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020130412e94c003gm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
