\par\par \b \uc2 Chile's Peso Marginally Weaker Prior to  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Policy Meeting\b0\par\par\uc2 By Sebastian Perez-Ferreiro   \par \uc2 272 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 April 2013\par 14:47\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO, Chile--The Chilean peso was marginally weaker in recent trading Thursday, after retreating the previous session from a 20-month high on a "verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 " from \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's finance minister.\par \par \uc2 The peso was recently at CLP468.60 to the dollar, from Wednesday's close of CLP468.50.\par \par \uc2 On Wednesday, the Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  pulled back from levels near where the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the exchange market in 2011, when it launched a $12 billion program to weaken the peso, after Finance Minister Felipe Larrain said he would meet with \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Rodrigo Vergara this week to discuss the "worrisome" exchange rate, in what was characterized as an attempt to talk down the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The peso retreated yesterday solely because of Larrain's verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , ignoring external factors, and today we were seeing a lot of institutional selling of pesos because the dollar is at an attractive rate," said Ronald Volpi, head of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  spot market at EuroAmerica.\par \par \uc2 Local traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's monetary policy meeting scheduled Thursday afternoon was pressuring investors to close out short positions on the dollar. The \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to refer to the exchange rate in the policy statement to be issued immediately afterward.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  always says in its statement that 'the peso has appreciated.' The question is, are they going to do something about it?," Mr. Volpi said.\par \par \uc2 (Peso quotes provided by Valor Futuro newswire.)\par \par \uc2 Write to Sebastian Perez-Ferreiro at sebastian.perez-ferreiros@dowjones.com [ 11-04-13 1247GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1170 1844   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130411e94b000nx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
