eady strong peso and that a market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is the prerogative of the autonomous \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 As the peso strengthens, exporters, the backbone of the local economy, lose competitiveness abroad.\par \par \uc2 Write to Carolina Pica at carolina.pica@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 April 10, 2013 09:05 ET (13:05 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020130410e94a002jm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
