\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  finance minister would support cbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  on peso\b0\par\par\uc2 407 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Januar 2013\par 10:32\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Peso boosted by strong \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  growth, copper\par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2011\par \par \uc2 * Larrain sees emerging markets remaining strong\par \par \uc2 DAVOS, Switzerland, Jan 26 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's government would support any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the country's independent \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the strong peso, Finance Minister Felipe Larrain said on Saturday.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may decide to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  but it is their own decision ...if they do, we would certainly support them," Larrain told Reuters in a television interview at the \uc2 World Economic Forum\uc2  in Davos.\par \par \uc2 "We're trying to prevent further appreciation," he said.\par \par \uc2 The peso, which has been boosted by Chile's robust economic growth and healthy prices for top export copper, ranked among the strongest foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  performers against the U.S. dollar among 152 \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  tracked by Reuters in 2012.\par \par \uc2 Last month, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  president Rodrigo Vergara reiterated that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local peso \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was a tool at the bank's disposal, but that if it hadn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  so far it was because it hadn't been deemed necessary.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  deployed a dollar-purchasing program in 2011 to curb peso strength after it appreciated to its highest level in more than 2-1/2 years at 465.50 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 Larrain said it was hard to counter the weight of U.S. quantitative easing: "Against this massive QE, we have a few tools but not many."\par \par \uc2 Chile's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has kept rates steady since a surprise cut in January 2012, as it weighs external risks against a buoyant domestic economy.\par \par \uc2 Due to robust domestic demand and investment, Chile's small, export-dependent economy has for the most part fared better than expected despite slowing demand from top trade partner China and fallout from the euro zone crisis.\par \par \uc2 Larrain added that the global economic picture was somewhat rosier at this year's Davos than in 2012.\par \par \uc2 "We're not yet out of the woods. The real economy still needs to undergo some tough work and the financial markets are helping but it's not to say this is over," Larrain said.\par \par \uc2 "It is the emerging markets that will continue pulling the world economy again in 2013."\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Emma Thomasson; editing by Jason Neely)\par \par \uc2 CHILE-PESO/FINANCEMINISTER | ABN | C | GRO | MTL | SOF | D | E | RBN | M | NAT | O | OIL | U | RNP | DNP | PTD | PCM | PEN   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020130126e91q0003s\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
