\par\par \b \uc2 *DJ Chile Government Concerned About Peso Strength -Finance Minister\b0\par\par\uc2 472 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Januar 2013\par 22:11\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2013, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 24 Jan 2013 16:11 EDT *DJ  \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2   Must Judge Whether \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Is Merited\par \par \uc2 24 Jan 2013 16:11 EDT *DJ  \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  Open to New Sovereign Issue Depending on Market Conditions\par \par \uc2 24 Jan 2013 16:11 EDT *DJ  Chile Finance Minister Felipe Larrain Spoke in Interview\par \par \uc2 24 Jan 2013 16:14 EDT DJ  Chile Government Concerned About Peso Strength -Finance Minister\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    By Carolina Pica and Laurence Norman \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 DAVOS, Switzerland--The Chilean government is concerned about the strength of the peso, which on Thursday closed at a 16-month high against the dollar, and has taken measures such as reining in the growth of fiscal spending to ease pressure on the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Finance Minister Felipe Larrain said Thursday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The peso has gained more than 10% since early 2012 and is reaching levels that prompted a $12 billion \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  program in January 2011.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "We share the concern about the exchange rate," Mr. Larrain said in a interview on the sidelines of the \f28 \uc2 \f2 World Economic Forum\f28 \uc2 \f2  in Davos, Switzerland.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "Exchange-rate pressures come from a very high level of international liquidity of the major \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , in particular of the dollar."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The government has attempted to partially offset the peso's gains through eased taxation for derivatives, keeping fiscal spending growth slower than gross-domestic-product growth and improving exporters' competitiveness.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Exporters, especially those in the agricultural sector, have been calling on the government to take more measures and on the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Mr. Larrain, who can voice an opinion at the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's monthly policy meetings but has no say in policy decisions, said the bank has made it clear it would step in if there were a compelling case for doing so.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 In an interview earlier this week, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  governor Rodrigo Vergara didn't provide any clues on whether there is an \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  looming, but he did warn that both the benefits and costs of such a move must be weighed.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "[The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ] has to judge if there are enough reasons to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ," Mr. Larrain said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Regarding any new sovereign issues, Mr. Larrain said the government was open to new issue, but that there is currently no need to tap international markets.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "If we do it, it's because the market conditions are right...We believe it will be very tough to beat what we did in 2012 in terms of the yield and the spread."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 In October, Chile issued $1.5 billion in 10-year and for the first time, 30-year bonds. The issue obtained the lowest yields ever for an emerging-market nation.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Carolina Pica at carolina.pica@dowjones.com and\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Laurence Norman at laurence.norman@dowjones.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 January 24, 2013 16:14 ET (21:14 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020130124e91o005tv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
