\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE:  \highlight22\uc2 Chile Intervention \highlight\uc2  Depends Solely on  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  -President\b0\par\par\uc2 438 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Januar 2013\par 16:54\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 --\b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  government closely monitoring peso's value against the dollar, president says\par \par \uc2 --Prudent fiscal spending has reduced strengthening pressure on peso\par \par \uc2 --\b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strength likely topic at upcoming summit of Latin American, Caribbean states\par \par \uc2 (updates with additional comments from President Pinera)\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Carolina Pica \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SANTIAGO, Chile--While the Chilean government closely monitors the strength of the country's peso in relation to the dollar, as this appreciation curbs the export sector's competitiveness abroad, market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is the prerogative of the autonomous \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , President Sebastian Pinera said Thursday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The peso has been trading firmer against the dollar so far this year, nearing levels that triggered a $12 billion \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  program in early 2011.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The peso's appreciation is in large part due to the depreciation the dollar has seen globally," Mr. Pinera said in a press conference with foreign correspondents.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 He added the government has contributed to reducing mounting pressures on the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by keeping fiscal spending at prudent levels, maintaining fiscal spending growth slower than gross domestic product growth.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Mr. Pinera pointed out that while Chile's GDP has grown at an average of about 6% since he took office in early 2010, fiscal spending has been gaining at around 5%.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 In 2012, the peso firmed around 8% against the dollar, and so far this year, it's hit three-month highs during several sessions as it trades near an important psychological barrier at CLP470 to the dollar.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 But Chile isn't the only country in the region grappling with a strong \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  as the U.S., the \f28 \uc2 \f2 European Union\f28 \uc2 \f2  and other large economies continue to inject additional stimulus into their economies.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Many Latin American nations have been weathering the global financial crisis with healthy growth, but their success has also fueled capital inflows as investors seek better returns. Several nations, such as Brazil and Peru, have seen \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 -market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to counter the strength of their \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  versus the dollar.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Later this month, Chile will be hosting the first summit of the Community of Latin American and Caribbean States, or CELAC by its Spanish acronym, and the topic of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strength will likely come up during the gathering.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The topic is one we're concerned with and we're obviously going to discuss this at the CELAC summit as it affects many countries in the region," Mr. Pinera said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The CELAC summit, which follows a similar summit in Santiago of CELAC and the E.U., will take place on Jan. 27 and 28.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Carolina Pica at carolina.pica@dowjones.com [ 17-01-13 1554GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130117e91h000qj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
