\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  Peso Ends At Three-Month High Amid New  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Calls\b0\par\par\uc2 By Graciela Ibanez   \par \uc2 328 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Januar 2013\par 18:05\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 The Chilean peso strengthened to close at a three-month high against the dollar Wednesday amid new \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  calls to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  from exporters who seek a weaker peso.\par \par \uc2 The peso ended at CLP470.70 to the dollar, versus Tuesday's close of CLP472.00, after trading in a wide range of CLP470.70 to CLP473.15.\par \par \uc2 Gains in copper prices after \uc2 Alcoa Inc\uc2 . (AA), the world's largest aluminum producer, reported strong fourth-quarter results contributed to the peso's gains.\par \par \uc2 As Chile produces one-third of the world's copper, the peso often moves in line with the industrial metal's price.\par \par \uc2 Manufacturer exporters in \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  asked the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to launch an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program as the peso's current level is hurting their competitiveness and threatening their survival.\par \par \uc2 During most of 2011, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market when the peso firmed to CLP465.40 to the dollar, buying a total of $12 billion.\par \par \uc2 If the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  soon, "many small exporters will die," said Roberto Fantuzzi, who leads the Asexma manufacturing exporter trade group.\par \par \uc2 The 2011 \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  "came late," he added in a statement.\par \par \uc2 Fears of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  have prompted investors to buy dollars when the peso reaches or crosses the level of CLP470 to the dollar.\par \par \uc2 Agricultural exporters have also called for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but the bank has repeatedly said the peso has traded in line with its long-term fundamentals.\par \par \uc2 In the fixed-income market, yields on inflation-indexed Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 central-bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bonds, or BCUs, ended flat.\par \par \uc2 The yield on five-year BCUs ended at 2.80%, while the yield on 10-year BCUs closed at 2.72%, both unchanged from Tuesday. Bond yields and bond prices move inversely.\par \par \uc2 (Peso and bond quotes provided by Valor Futuro newswire.)\par \par \uc2 Write to Graciela Ibanez at graciela.ibanez@dowjones.com. [ 09-01-13 1705GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1170 1844   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130109e919000w3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
