\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  Peso Trades at 1-Yr High, Close to 2011  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Level\b0\par\par\uc2 By Graciela Ibanez   \par \uc2 225 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 September 2012\par 13:47\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 The Chilean peso strengthened Thursday to a one-year high against the dollar on expectations that China could launch another round of economic stimulus after a recent massive liquidity injection.\par \par \uc2 The peso is trading at CLP468.40 to the dollar versus Wednesday's close of CLP470.50.\par \par \uc2 The peso often takes cues from Chinese economic developments as China is Chile's main trading partner and its largest copper customer. Chile produces one-third of the world's copper.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market after the peso had firmed to a 32-month high at CLP465.40 to the dollar in the first days of January 2011.\par \par \uc2 Last year, the bank bought a total of $12 billion at a rate of $50 million a day increasing its foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to 15% of gross domestic product.\par \par \uc2 Although the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  can't rule out another peso \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the cost of such a move would be too high, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Rodrigo Vergara said recently.\par \par \uc2 "If the peso crosses the CLP465 level, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Francisco Schneider, head of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at Celfin Capital.\par \par \uc2 (Peso quotes provided by Valor Futuro newswire.)\par \par \uc2 Write to Graciela Ibanez at graciela.ibanez@dowjones.com [ 27-09-12 1216GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120927e89r000r4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
