\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE:  \highlight22\uc2 Chile Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Can't Rule Out Peso  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  -Governor\b0\par\par\uc2 525 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 September 2012\par 18:17\par \uc2 Dow Jones News Service\par \uc2 DJ\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 --Conditions not right for peso market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 --New \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  could hurt \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  balance sheet\par \par \uc2 --Legal delays in energy projects could slow growth in coming years\par \par \uc2 (Adds comments and quotes from \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor, starting in fifth paragraph)\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Carolina Pica \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SANTIAGO, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Chile\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 --The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Chile\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  can't rule out \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the peso market, although the costs of such a move would outweigh the benefits, bank governor Rodrigo Vergara said Friday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Following the \f28 \uc2 \f2 European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's bond purchasing announcement earlier this week, the peso on Friday firmed to a 12-month high against the dollar.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Mr. Vergara said the bank could \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  if the peso were out of line with its fundametals, which isn't the case for the Andean \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "If the peso were significantly and persistently out of line with its fundamentals, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  would be used as an exceptional measure," Mr. Vergara said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  doesn't give up the possibility of an \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . We've done it before and we could do it in the future," he said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 As Chile's economy depends heavily on its exports, a strong peso cuts into the competitiveness of its products abroad.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 In recent years, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in 2008 and then in 2011. In last year's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  program, it bought a total $12 billion at a rate of $50 million a day.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Following that \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , the bank increased its foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves to 15% of gross domestic product.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 According to Mr. Vergara, further increasing these reserves could bring financial costs and put a crimp in the bank's balance sheet.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "It's important to understand that \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  have financial costs that all Chileans end up paying because the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  buys dollars and finances these purchases through domestic debt that is more expensive than the returns obtained from the foreign reserves, so we have to be extremely responsible and prudent because these costs are relevant," the central banker said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 He reiterated, as he's done in previous speeches, that a free-floating exchange rate is the best defense mechanism against international volatility.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Regarding the measures the \f28 \uc2 \f2 European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  announced this week concerning bond purchases, Mr. Vergara warned markets should remain cautious.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The [ECB] announcement is a step in the right direction, but one should remain cautious as this isn't the first time we've heard 'this time is for real.' There are many other measures and reforms to be carried out," the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  governor said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  doesn't usually comment on local policies so it was unexpected for Mr. Vergara to also comment on recent local court rulings that have held up electricity generation projects.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The delay of several large generation projects will likely increase power costs, which are already among the highest in the region and possibly curb economic growth, Mr. Vergara said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "These [electricity] problems will manifest themselves a few years from now and they'll have repercussions on productivity and eventually on growth," he said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Carolina Pica at carolina.pica@dowjones.com [ 09-07-12 1217ET ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJ00000020120907e897000ek\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
