\par\par \b \uc2 *DJ  \highlight22\uc2 Chile Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Can't Rule Out Peso  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  -Governor\b0\par\par\uc2 217 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 September 2012\par 14:28\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2012, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 7 Sep 2012 08:28 EDT *DJ  \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  Peso's Strength Still Within Its Fundamentals- \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Head\par \par \uc2 7 Sep 2012 08:28 EDT *DJ  \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  Peso \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Costs Would Outweigh Benefits- \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Head\par \par \uc2 7 Sep 2012 09:05 EDT DJ  \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Can't Rule Out Peso \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  --Governor\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Carolina Pica \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SANTIAGO, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Chile\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 --The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Chile\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  can't rule out \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the peso market, although the costs of such a move would outweigh the benefits, bank governor Rodrigo Vergara said Friday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Following the \f28 \uc2 \f2 European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's bond purchasing announcement earlier this week, the peso on Friday firmed to a 12-month high against the dollar.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Mr. Vergara said the bank could \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  if the peso were out of line with its fundametals, which isn't the case for the Andean \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "If the peso was significantly and persistently out of line with its fundamentals, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  would be used as an exceptional measure," Mr. Vergara said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 As Chile's economy depends heavily on its exports, a strong peso cuts into the competitiveness of its products abroad.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Carolina Pica at carolina.pica@dowjones.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 September 07, 2012 09:05 ET (13:05 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020120907e8970039e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
