\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  cenbank has no trigger for  \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 352 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2012\par 22:12\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 PUNTA DEL ESTE, Uruguay, March 1 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not have a set level that triggers \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  board member Enrique Marshall said on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The Chilean peso has firmed by 7.85 percent since the start of the year, putting increasing pressure on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to resume its dollar purchases on the market to stem the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's appreciation, which hurts exporters.\par \par \uc2 Many Latin American \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  have strengthened as regional economic growth attracts investors seeking higher returns than they can get in more developed markets. That has prompted \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by central banks in Brazil, Colombia and Peru.\par \par \uc2 "We don't have any reference level for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  or not. We have to evaluate and have to see if the circumstances justify it and that's what we've done in the past," Marshall told reporters on the sidelines of a seminar on macroprudential policies organized by the International Monetary Fund and Uruguay's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 He said the bank's policy was to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in "special or extraordinary" circumstances.\par \par \uc2 The peso is currently bidding at 481.50 per dollar. When the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  last year, it was trading at 465.50 and the bank made its move in 2008 when it reached around 430 pesos per dollar.\par \par \uc2 Commenting on the wider economy, Marshall said credit growth of about 12 percent was a "reasonable" level and had a healthy correlation to the rate of economic growth.\par \par \uc2 "In Chile what we are observing is an expansion of credit but it is still within a limited range, therefore there is no particular concern about that growth," he said.\par \par \uc2 Chile's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  board said holding its key interest rate steady at 5.0 percent in February was coherent and pointed to a gradual and paused process of rate moves, minutes of the bank's rate-setting meeting showed.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Hilary Burke and Malena Castaldi; Editing by Andrew Hay)\par \par \uc2 CHILE-CREDIT/ | ABN | D | E | RBN | M | NAT | U | RNP | DNP | PTD   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020120301e831001dm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
